    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34656" root="فندر" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِنْدِيرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِنْدِيرَةٌ</span></b>  (K in this art., and S in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فدر</span>,) <i>A great mass of rock that becomes detached</i>
(S, K) <i>from the head</i> (S) or <i>from the side</i> (K) <i>of
a mountain:</i> (S, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنَادِيرُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And,
both words, <i>A large lump</i> of dates (K, TA) <i>compacted together;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِدْرَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

